TML, embedded Mermaid and description tables were inspected, but rendered legibility, clipping and layout could not be verified."],"advice":["The sequence correctly describes bootstrap authentication before checkout, qualification and raw pinning before fencing, and preload-protected archived rollback. Consider adding the separately contracted managed acknowledgement-before-preparation path and provisional selector publication to make those ordering boundaries visible.","The ownership and relationship prose is sufficient for this assignment; no additional ERD or UX mock is necessary solely because of artifact size."]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"incomplete","summary":"Reconciled all five fresh substantive assessments against the originating ISSUE and current canonical/live LLD. All 47 inventory selectors have declared inspection coverage, and current fingerprints match the reviewed baseline. Three prior findings are resolved; both prior companion-link origins remain carried. Accepted fresh feedback identifies two MED defects. Mandatory rendered-diagram verification remains incomplete.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/macos-portable-qualification-5d5478c6.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-5d5478c61a25ac8f-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/ISSUE.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/sequence-diagram.html","Checkpoint attempts 1 and 2: accepted completed feedback, preceding report and effectiveFindingOrigins","Checkpoint attempt 3 completedChunks: scope, qualification, lifecycle, entrypoints and visuals","Checkpoint attempt 3 pl