ure as explicit alternative branches when the sequence format supports them. Current labels and descriptions convey the conditions, but the generated Mermaid places success before rollback in one numbered sequence; branch grouping would clarify the commit boundary and fenced uncertainty."]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"incomplete","summary":"Reconciled all five completed chunks against the current LLD and originating ISSUE. Every inventory selector has recorded inspection coverage, and current document and canonical fingerprints match the reviewed baseline. No additional cross-section defect was demonstrated. Existing MED findings remain applicable; mandatory rendered-diagram verification remains incomplete.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/macos-portable-qualification-5d5478c6.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/ISSUE.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-5d5478c61a25ac8f-s1.json","Checkpoint attempt 1: inventory and accepted completed feedback for scope, qualification, lifecycle, entrypoints and visuals","LLD.md:49-54, 81-107, 117-160, 168-208","Canonical LLD: /body/sequenceDefinition, /body/companions","scripts/insrc-daemon-install.sh:164-223","src/daemon/managed-update-recovery.ts:168-241","src/daemon/managed-update-transaction.ts:18-45"],"limitations":["Mandatory rendering verification remains outstanding for /Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/sequence-diagram.html. The accepted visuals feedback records an unavailable browser access host; source inspection does not establish rendered legibility, clipping or layout."],"advice":["Retain