/daemon/__tests__/macos-upgrade-routing.test.ts","src/daemon/__tests__/managed-release-staging.test.ts:qualification and broker-denial fixtures","src/daemon/__tests__/fresh-managed-activation.test.ts:installer fixtures","src/daemon/__tests__/managed-update-ipc.test.ts:test coverage","src/daemon/__tests__/linux-installed-lifecycle.test.ts","src/daemon/__tests__/fixtures/linux-installed-lifecycle.sh","vscode-plugin/src/daemon/controller.ts","vscode-plugin/src/daemon/paths.ts","vscode-plugin/src/freshness/daemon-freshness.ts:202-298","vscode-plugin/src/extension.ts:225-244","vscode-plugin/package.json:917-921","jetbrains-plugin/src/main/kotlin/ai/insors/insrc/jetbrains/lifecycle/ScriptDaemonProvisioner.kt","jetbrains-plugin/src/main/kotlin/ai/insors/insrc/jetbrains/lifecycle/DaemonLifecycleCommandRunner.kt","jetbrains-plugin/src/main/kotlin/ai/insors/insrc/jetbrains/lifecycle/DaemonLifecycleService.kt:DefaultDaemonScriptLocator","jetbrains-plugin/src/main/kotlin/ai/insors/insrc/jetbrains/freshness/DaemonFreshnessFlow.kt:116-202","jetbrains-plugin/src/main/kotlin/ai/insors/insrc/jetbrains/freshness/InstalledCommitFreshnessConsumer.kt:production wiring","jetbrains-plugin/src/main/kotlin/ai/insors/insrc/jetbrains/daemon/UnixSocketDaemonRpc.kt:bounded update replies","jetbrains-plugin/build.gradle.kts:installer resource packaging","docs/daemon.md:macOS installed lifecycle and configured update source"],"limitations":[],"advice":["The current routing fixture expects clone/build/controller execution before authorization. Update that expectation when implementing the proposed trusted bootstrap; its current success cannot establish the revised security contract.","Existing installer and broker-denial fixtures use synthetic product programs. Preserve the LLD's separate requirement for independent production builds and immutable real-product qualification receipts before promotion.","No installation, launchd or release qualification tests were executed during this read-only design review."]},{"chunkId":"visuals","status":"incomplete","summary":"Inspected the complete sequence definition, all participants, companion source and live link against the issue and current contracts. The sequence misrepresents mutually exclusive lifecycle paths, and the companion link remains broken. Actual rendering verification remains technically unavailable.","findings":[{"id":"visuals-a3-unconditional-lifecycle","severity":"MED","location":"/body/sequenceDefinition/messages/8","message":"The generated sequence presents Start child → Verify readiness → Verify idle → Commit success → Reconcile candidate → Restore archived prior → Publish rollback as one unconditional call order. This contradicts the running/idle alternatives and the rule that durable success must never roll back. The description table qualifies some messages, but those conditions are absent from the diagram itself. Represent running versus idle and success versus uncommitted failure as explicit alternatives, retaining the stopped predecessor condition on restoration.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-5d5478c61a25ac8f-s1.json: /body/sequenceDefinition/messages/8 through /14","docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/sequence-diagram.html: embedded Mermaid source and Messages table","docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/LLD.md: sections 2.2, 2.3 and migration steps 6–7","src/daemon/managed-update-handoff.ts: stageManagedCandidate returns without starting a child for a stopped predecessor","src/daemon/managed-update-transaction.ts: settleManagedUpdate and recoverManagedTransaction separate committed activation from rollback"]},{"id":"visuals-a3-relative-companion-link","severity":"LOW","location":"docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/LLD.md:163","message":"The live document still links to docs/standalone/.../S001/sequence-diagram.html from inside th