signed inventories, real running and stopped migration matrix, and restored-adapter tests covering worker replacement, public stop admission, private drain authentication and interrupted recovery. Those future qualification runs were not executed during this read-only design review."]},{"chunkId":"lifecycle","status":"passed","summary":"The assigned lifecycle design is consistent with the originating ISSUE and inspected predecessor/controller behavior. It specifies admission before legacy shutdown side effects, separate authenticated private drain authority, worker replacement containment, exact-exit reconciliation, guarded rollback publication, and preservation of durable success. The proposed tests cover the relevant client, concurrency and interruption paths. No blocking design defect was demonstrated.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/migration","/citations/1","/citations/2","/citations/3","/citations/4","/citations/5","/citations/6","/citations/10","/citations/11","/citations/19","/citations/20","/citations/21","/citations/23","/citations/24","/citations/25","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/LLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-5d5478c61a25ac8f-s1.json",".insrc/tmp/design-review/macos-portable-qualification-5d5478c6.json — inspected prior lifecycle-public-shutdown-admission-a3 evidence","docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/ISSUE.md","git:ab6a96296ea6f2bde948636424218c0a23136c74:src/daemon/admin-handlers.ts — both handler factories and original shutdown/update side effects","git:ab6a96296ea6f2bde948636424218c0a23136c74:src/daemon/threads/admin-worker.ts — shutdown forwarding","git:ab6a96296ea6f2bde948636424218c0a23136c74:src/daemon/index.ts — main shutdown routing and worker startup","src/shared/managed-d