uence-diagram.html and /Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/component-dependency.html remains incomplete. A fresh browser rendering attempt returned 'The browser access host is unavailable'. Both HTML sources, Mermaid definitions and description tables were inspected; rendered correctness, legibility, clipping and layout were not verified.","Mandatory actual rendering verification remains incomplete for /Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/sequence-diagram.html and /Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/component-dependency.html. Accepted fresh attempt 4 visuals feedback records a browser rendering attempt returning 'The browser access host is unavailable'. HTML, Mermaid definitions, descriptions and link targets were inspected; rendered correctness, legibility, clipping and layout remain unverified."],"reviewer":"daemon","reviewedContentIdentity":"8f4113497dd9ee58eb02aae6ff1c54c41fabbad245d3f37f748902d862f59323","impact":{"baselineAttempt":3,"mode":"full","coverageOrigins":[{"chunkId":"scope","kind":"fresh"},{"chunkId":"qualification","kind":"fresh"},{"chunkId":"lifecycle","kind":"fresh"},{"chunkId":"entrypoints","kind":"fresh"},{"chunkId":"visuals","kind":"fresh"},{"chunkId":"consistency","kind":"fresh"}],"findingDecisions":[{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"visuals","findingId":"visuals-relative-companion-link"},"rationale":"Current source uses a local companion link and fresh feedback confirms its target exists. However, the selected fresh visuals inspection remains incomplete because mandatory rendering is unavailable. Carry this origin pending accepted fresh inspection without mandatory gaps.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:166","Canonical /body/companions/0","Checkpoint attempt 4 completedChunk